     It REPLACES zs-editorial.css, which it is a superset of: same system,
     plus the control-edge fix (that file's border measured 2.57:1 against the
     top of its own button fill, missing WCAG 1.4.11), the 44px toggle, and
     the .pk colour/size/selection bugs. -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="zs-kit.css">
<!-- zs-fixes.css: defects found by SCREENSHOTTING the running exe — the
     active config's name truncated to "BO7 - Na…" because a three-line
     status stack and a 44px chevron box were starving it of width. Computed-
